[294.694, "o", "\u001b[1;35m\u23fa Claude\u001b[0m\r\n  Everything is wired correctly. `npm run build` and `npm run test` both pass. I attempted to spin up a local server t\r\n  o visually verify in a browser, but the sandbox blocked starting background/server processes without interactive app\r\n  roval \u2014 you can run `npm run dev` locally to see it live.\r\n  \r\n  Summary of what was added on top of the existing scaffold:\r\n  \r\n  1. **FilterBar** \u2014 country filter is now a searchable dropdown (`CountrySelect` in `FilterBar.jsx`) listing only cou\r\n  ntries present in the data, with selected-country chips below it; region chips, both sliders, and the reach toggle w\r\n  ere already present and remain live via `useMemo` in `App.jsx`.\r\n  2. **Currency + compact total line** \u2014 `UniversityCard` now shows `\u2248 $X total/yr` under the location line, alongside\r\n   the existing formatted cost breakdown.\r\n  3. **Sort control** \u2014 added to `ResultsGrid` (Best match / Lowest total cost / Ranking), applied via a new `sortedRe\r\n  sults` `useMemo` in `App.jsx`.\r\n  4. **Empty-results state** \u2014 `NoResults` now includes a \"Relax filters\" button wired to a new `resetFilters()` in `A\r\n  pp.jsx`.\r\n  5. **Mobile bottom sheet** \u2014 a \"Filters\" toggle button with an active-filter-count badge, backdrop, slide-up sheet (\r\n  CSS `tran\r\n\r\n"]
